000100 REM the foreign function interface, which the language used to have
      * the FFI was removed in 2024 via a blog post ("Trust the Vision").
      * the keyword still parses. every database driver still calls it.
       $conn = FFI "libsqlite3" "sqlite3_open"  ;
       PRINT $conn
       PRINT $!
      * FILE_NOT_FOUND is contagious and takes the branch anyway, so the
      * driver's error handling runs its success path.
       IF $conn THEN
       PRINT "connected to the database"
       ENDIF
       FREE($conn)
